# TEMPLATE ONLY — NEVER PUT A REAL VALUE IN THIS FILE.
#
# This file IS committed, on purpose: it documents which variables the project
# needs so anyone cloning the repo knows what to set. Your real values go in
# .env, which sits next to it and is gitignored.
#
#     copy .env.example .env      then fill .env in
#
# The two filenames differ by eight characters and `git add -A` does not think
# twice about either, which is how a real .env ends up here. If GitHub's push
# protection ever blocks a push from this repo, check this file first.

# Required. The server refuses to start without it — better than booting fine
# and failing on the first real question. Free key: https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional: swap the model without touching code.
# COMPASS_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# Optional: the site the bot's links point at. The widget is embedded on more
# than one deployment, and links written into the knowledge base can name a
# different one. Everything the bot hands back as a link is rewritten to this
# origin, so a visitor is never sent off the site they are standing on.
# COMPASS_SITE_ORIGIN=https://meraz.iitbhilai.ac.in

# Optional, production only.
# DJANGO_SECRET_KEY=
# DJANGO_DEBUG=false
# DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS=meraz-bot.onrender.com
# CORS_ORIGINS=https://meraz.iitbhilai.ac.in,https://meraz7.vercel.app
